{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>53歲李冰冰時隔10年再度踏上康城影展紅毯！她5月16日以品牌代言人身分，出席第79屆康城影展非競賽片《因果報應（Karma）》首映，一身銀灰色Armani</p><p>她5月16日以品牌代言人身分，出席第79屆康城影展非競賽片《因果報應（Karma）》首映，一身銀灰色Armani Privé高級訂製禮服驚艷全場，更被外媒盛讚是「東方美學與南法陽光的完美碰撞」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260517/1132623604773556224723904.jpeg/GwrhhXLxKFa2Qjx2msdNSapQ80kKV0sLhig724YoO9s\" alt=\"李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）\"><figcaption>李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）</figcaption></figure><p>這也是李冰冰繼2016年後，再度現身康城紅毯，同時也是她第9次參與康城影展。相較10年前偏向強勢女王氣場的黑白禮服造型，這回她改走優雅淡然路線，選穿Armani Privé 2025春夏高訂系列銀灰色薄紗禮服，以水墨暈染手法呈現山水紋理，搭配平口剪裁與晶鑽刺繡，在燈光下更顯飄逸夢幻。</p><p>珠寶部分，李冰冰則搭配CHAUMET Joséphine Valse Impériale系列高級珠寶，閃耀鑽石與水墨感禮服相互呼應，層次感十足。整體造型融合了法式宮廷華麗感與東方含蓄美學，也讓不少時尚媒體大讚她展現獨特「淡雅水墨風」。</p><p>更多李冰冰的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469034184704823104.png/ZrXNJcEmEdLXvWraOsCE0jqdM1st5CQB1FrZT9Ra2U8\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469281648640487503.png/rLVrOY1cQZqkY_YZxI-KQ1MD9zAPxmgad_U37nf1N-4\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469424254976561834.png/w6NqEbK4PL6NFPR41Nmn073hTkgIiLuT_MhQvPzIULw\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469805936640702534.png/Z7_uGGjQnwbchSv11IRcmW0LxWHJEKtbPQhl7j0IZe4\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465313574912802549.png/VdxiIKyQz8GCllkiISj1uoDeQ2It_To78wEDjvMBA44\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465506512896807231.png/qt1UTgmdh8Y4qJ8GZKAo0gJxurbAxG7p1c2TGNXNkxg\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465556844544631725.png/nmT80BJ6FtRoup91XtAQCmyhHXoegj7KuVhXSLlYV0g\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465980469248574681.png/UOCHl2vbYoOMEacdjsyKhFIhBmCTqwrbmV1zJZldcyU\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782466995621888942168.png/8NzZkGaU84oqCW70RFd5Ah1pEDhNZI4RQSSwdkEksHY\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782467322777600078346.png/mkE0-bS4hLK2zlDivvEPPvmKYgi2KI9a11OzJ9dTsyc\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782467524104192938056.png/P0V3sixJC2qr7A17tit_do_m_3PvXlFKsckjt7HJI7c\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782467914174464390578.png/1KZoFMigTTfVriYhQ4KICERHYpH1ZEOMpNj0i6TY9Is\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782461139980288214957.png/K1saX7n-izQqUo6kHY0V46WuKkdtAdg0dVT933VU_d8\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782461320335360697045.png/mTkPlBLtLHqfQddxh4kWkYFxrlqhI_6nbC_KDGwvygw\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782461945286656420875.png/oQBebRNs6JzFhkYwT_dRASQBc8sCnr3gtIj1abSI9Wk\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782461894955008650987.png/lCEP5Jr-6BDYuxkAK_97evWv6UgN-h4edR_Cd3Ufwnc\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782463337926656273618.png/VkzVZn8EyUK1Ym3jKuVuOc-rW2bLXOirAH01VAB9NVQ\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><p>李冰冰受訪時也坦言，這次重返康城的心情與過往截然不同：</p><p>相較年輕時參加國際盛會的緊繃感，如今多了份自在與從容。</p><p>延伸閱讀：黃曉明現身「婦產科」惹當爸疑雲　工作室急曬單據闢謠揭舊患復發</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131194217767374848298406.png/utaNXpK94PCIkHIp4O7MHNEVjh2ei-pqiuPBwIrjwcA\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：黃曉明現身「婦產科」惹當爸疑雲　工作室急曬單據闢謠揭舊患復發】大陸狗仔拍到黃曉明現身醫院。（微博@會拍攝的百曉生）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：黃曉明現身「婦產科」惹當爸疑雲　工作室急曬單據闢謠揭舊患復發】大陸狗仔拍到黃曉明現身醫院。（微博@會拍攝的百曉生）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131195217559425024962435.png/CeFQ-OjgjaZhXdELUU_qvPAoDrCwkga_TjYUp042FKc\" alt=\"面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）\"><figcaption>面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131195219849646080367421.jpeg/nHTomIhjlCfzsj4L7AC0iCLHAisfu3TZ4mkuJOJpLiQ\" alt=\"面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）\"><figcaption>面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131195222131478528583940.jpeg/mfTiHe-TnqD4K1W3O84Ml79bwEUgTOppCQY5-gkGOfo\" alt=\"面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）\"><figcaption>面對外界猜測，黃曉明工作室火速闢謠，直接點名「會拍攝的百曉生」回應。（微博@黃曉明工作室）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131194737597091840908216.jpeg/sEL6KtprJ1z9_R7tcpSRRp7gMgtkEcF_3NyQsdzckLE\" alt=\"黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）\"><figcaption>黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131194740281577472408632.jpeg/Frh1hp54KH5wZKROMByKLfjeaDWbkEQ3aSZMEmkmTBI\" alt=\"黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）\"><figcaption>黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131194731838050304634209.jpeg/wkLvKvzIVqkJAZ6Qk5344QXisW7Xpq6CsOnYDbDp2A0\" alt=\"黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）\"><figcaption>黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131194734845497344705914.jpeg/SmMDoyu9J4zSB7_0cjiIMLh7SVMSrjgvMJvlkDCb5ZA\" alt=\"黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）\"><figcaption>黃曉明（微博@黃曉明）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>專訪／何諭函失戀「暈」出人間清醒　放棄動畫跳進演員路追夢</p><p>坎城影展／全智賢新片坎城首映掌聲如雷！濱口龍介新片直視老人安養</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-17T06:41:08.838572+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1118,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}